1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,357
Christmas is not an emergency.

2
00:00:02,777 --> 00:00:04,807
It's on the calendar. Every single year.

3
00:00:05,227 --> 00:00:10,882
Say your yearly surprise costs add up to $1,700. That's $66 a paycheck.

4
00:00:11,302 --> 00:00:17,915
Put them on a credit card and pay $66 a paycheck afterward, and after five years you still owe $784.

5
00:00:18,335 --> 00:00:21,034
Save the same $66 first, and you owe nothing.

6
00:00:21,454 --> 00:00:23,281
Same money. Opposite results.

7
00:00:24,051 --> 00:00:27,333
It's called a sinking fund. The full video is on my channel.
